<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9233" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνόμοιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<i><span class="en">
			Pl.
			<u>Phlb.</u>
			13e
		</span></i>, etc., also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Isoc.
			12.225
		</span></i>, etc.:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unlike,
				dissimilar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				8.28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινι</span>
			<i>unlike</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				513b
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀνομοίων ἡ
			πόλις</span> is composed of <i>dissimilar elements,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1277a5
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.84
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				388c
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					7.7.49
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of number, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτερομήκης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				9
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				58
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
